1. System requirements
Python 3.12.4
PyTorch 2.2.2+cu118 True 11.8


2. Demo
We provide a detailed demo of our code：
1. Set the cell and operating parameters in Constant.py.
2. Before running, ensure that all required files are present in the working directory.
3. CPINN_NET.py defines the sub-network architectures.
4. Data_gets2.py and NTK_algo.py implement the sampling and loss-optimization algorithms, respectively, and are called in Main.py.
5. Run the main script Main.py to solve the LIB multiphysics model.


Make sure all dependencies listed in requirements.txt are installed before running the scripts.
